an8.13:1.15 | S: He always walks in a straight path. | T: [7] “When going, he goes the straight path.
an8.13:1.16 | S: He’s strong, and stays strong even until death. | T: [8] “He is steadfast and remains steadfast to the end of life & death.
an8.13:1.17 | S: A fine royal thoroughbred with these eight factors is worthy of a king. … | T: “Endowed with these eight qualities, a king’s auspicious thoroughbred steed is worthy of a king, is a king’s asset, counts as a very limb of his king.
