sn42.8:6.5 | S: ‘My teacher has this doctrine and view: | T: ‘Our teacher holds this doctrine, holds this view:
sn42.8:6.6 | S: “Everyone who kills a living creature, steals, commits sexual misconduct, or lies goes to a place of loss, to hell.” | T: “All those who take life are destined for a plane of deprivation, are destined for hell.”
